        "acceptance": "Kernel-checked parser/selection relation binds raw source bytes and source context to the supported syntax; current tests and hash binding remain evidence only.",
        "id": "S0",
        "obligation": "Host parser and Python AST selection correctness",
        "status": "OPEN"
      },
