        "acceptance": "Specify Float rounding, math.fsum, exp/log1p approximation, overflow and finite guards; derive certified step/error bounds and a perturbation convergence or finite-epoch accuracy theorem for the actual implementation.",
        "id": "S5",
        "obligation": "CPython/math.fsum and binary64 execution refinement",
        "status": "OPEN"
      },
      {
        "acceptance": "Add checked language coverage with provenance and abstention, incremental content-addressed AST/KG/vector/contract refresh, typed logic-family projection certificates and a justified training objective. Ranker convergence does not establish autoencoder convergence.",
        "id": "S6",
        "obligation": "General codebase autoencoder IR soundness and convergence",
        "status": "OPEN"
      },
      {
        "acceptance": "Resolve each prompt requirement against current source-backed IR and retrieved obligations; bind action pre/postconditions and evaluator checks to all required RPI exits before task completion. Navigation ranking and kernel subtheorems do not establish a task score.",
        "id": "S7",
        "obligation": "Intent-to-codebase planning and full Terminal Bench satisfaction",
        "status": "OPEN"
      }
